# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `wrangler pages dev`. Names only, never values.
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY is the one credential in this system that cannot be
# rotated quietly. It is read ONLY by the Function in functions/. It must never
# be given a VITE_ prefix -- Vite inlines VITE_ variables into the browser bundle.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# SUPABASE_URL IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT since R-2026-09-22-59. The origin this
# Function calls is TRACKED CONFIGURATION in packages/origins, chosen by the
# request's hostname -- not an environment variable. Adding it back here would
# have no effect: nothing on the /beds.json path reads it.
